{"id":"idiom","name":"四字成语","description":"常用成语，兼顾打字速度与词汇积累","category":"成语","tags":["成语","挑战"],"level":3,"length":40,"words":[{"id":"idiom-0","word":"一心一意","pinyin":["yì","xīn","yí","yì"],"flat":"yixinyiyi","flatSpaced":"yi xin yi yi","toneNum":"yi4 xin1 yi2 yi4","initials":"yxyy","syllables":["yi","xin","yi","yi"],"trans":"wholeheartedly; with full attention","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他一心一意地学习。","en":"He studies with full attention."},{"zh":"请一心一意地工作。","en":"Please work wholeheartedly."},{"zh":"她一心一意地画画。","en":"She paints with full attention."}],"example":"他一心一意地学习。","exampleTrans":"He studies with full attention."},{"id":"idiom-1","word":"三心二意","pinyin":["sān","xīn","èr","yì"],"flat":"sanxineryi","flatSpaced":"san xin er yi","toneNum":"san1 xin1 er4 yi4","initials":"sxey","syllables":["san","xin","er","yi"],"trans":"half-hearted; absent-minded","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"学习不能三心二意。","en":"You cannot study half-heartedly."},{"zh":"他做事三心二意。","en":"He does things absent-mindedly."},{"zh":"别三心二意了。","en":"Stop being half-hearted."}],"example":"学习不能三心二意。","exampleTrans":"You cannot study half-heartedly."},{"id":"idiom-2","word":"四面八方","pinyin":["sì","miàn","bā","fāng"],"flat":"simianbafang","flatSpaced":"si mian ba fang","toneNum":"si4 mian4 ba1 fang1","initials":"smbf","syllables":["si","mian","ba","fang"],"trans":"from all sides; in all directions","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"人们从四面八方赶来。","en":"People came from all directions."},{"zh":"消息传遍四面八方。","en":"The news spread everywhere."},{"zh":"四面八方都是山。","en":"There are mountains in all directions."}],"example":"人们从四面八方赶来。","exampleTrans":"People came from all directions."},{"id":"idiom-3","word":"五光十色","pinyin":["wǔ","guāng","shí","sè"],"flat":"wuguangshise","flatSpaced":"wu guang shi se","toneNum":"wu3 guang1 shi2 se4","initials":"wgss","syllables":["wu","guang","shi","se"],"trans":"multicolored; dazzling","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"商店里五光十色。","en":"The shop is dazzling with colors."},{"zh":"灯光五光十色。","en":"The lights are multicolored."},{"zh":"节日的夜晚五光十色。","en":"The festival night is dazzling."}],"example":"商店里五光十色。","exampleTrans":"The shop is dazzling with colors."},{"id":"idiom-4","word":"七上八下","pinyin":["qī","shàng","bā","xià"],"flat":"qishangbaxia","flatSpaced":"qi shang ba xia","toneNum":"qi1 shang4 ba1 xia4","initials":"qsbx","syllables":["qi","shang","ba","xia"],"trans":"anxious; unsettled (lit. seven up, eight down)","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"我的心里七上八下。","en":"My heart is in turmoil."},{"zh":"听到消息，他七上八下。","en":"Hearing the news, he felt uneasy."},{"zh":"考试前我七上八下。","en":"I was anxious before the exam."}],"example":"我的心里七上八下。","exampleTrans":"My heart is in turmoil."},{"id":"idiom-5","word":"九牛一毛","pinyin":["jiǔ","niú","yì","máo"],"flat":"jiuniuyimao","flatSpaced":"jiu niu yi mao","toneNum":"jiu3 niu2 yi4 mao2","initials":"jnym","syllables":["jiu","niu","yi","mao"],"trans":"a drop in the bucket; negligible","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"这点钱只是九牛一毛。","en":"This money is just a drop in the bucket."},{"zh":"他的财富是九牛一毛。","en":"His wealth is negligible by comparison."},{"zh":"对大海来说，这点雨是九牛一毛。","en":"To the ocean, this rain is a drop in the bucket."}],"example":"这点钱只是九牛一毛。","exampleTrans":"This money is just a drop in the bucket."},{"id":"idiom-6","word":"百发百中","pinyin":["bǎi","fā","bǎi","zhòng"],"flat":"baifabaizhong","flatSpaced":"bai fa bai zhong","toneNum":"bai3 fa1 bai3 zhong4","initials":"bfbz","syllables":["bai","fa","bai","zhong"],"trans":"every shot hits; 100% accurate","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他百发百中。","en":"He never misses a shot."},{"zh":"神枪手百发百中。","en":"The sharpshooter hits every time."},{"zh":"他的预测百发百中。","en":"His predictions are always accurate."}],"example":"他百发百中。","exampleTrans":"He never misses a shot."},{"id":"idiom-7","word":"千军万马","pinyin":["qiān","jūn","wàn","mǎ"],"flat":"qianjunwanma","flatSpaced":"qian jun wan ma","toneNum":"qian1 jun1 wan4 ma3","initials":"qjwm","syllables":["qian","jun","wan","ma"],"trans":"a vast army; a huge force","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"战场上有千军万马。","en":"There is a vast army on the battlefield."},{"zh":"千军万马过独木桥。","en":"A huge crowd crosses the single-log bridge."},{"zh":"他带领千军万马。","en":"He led a huge army."}],"example":"战场上有千军万马。","exampleTrans":"There is a vast army on the battlefield."},{"id":"idiom-8","word":"万紫千红","pinyin":["wàn","zǐ","qiān","hóng"],"flat":"wanziqianhong","flatSpaced":"wan zi qian hong","toneNum":"wan4 zi3 qian1 hong2","initials":"wzqh","syllables":["wan","zi","qian","hong"],"trans":"a blaze of color; thriving","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"春天万紫千红。","en":"Spring is a blaze of color."},{"zh":"花园里万紫千红。","en":"The garden is full of colors."},{"zh":"万紫千红的春天真美。","en":"The colorful spring is beautiful."}],"example":"春天万紫千红。","exampleTrans":"Spring is a blaze of color."},{"id":"idiom-9","word":"自相矛盾","pinyin":["zì","xiāng","máo","dùn"],"flat":"zixiangmaodun","flatSpaced":"zi xiang mao dun","toneNum":"zi4 xiang1 mao2 dun4","initials":"zxmd","syllables":["zi","xiang","mao","dun"],"trans":"self-contradictory","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他的话自相矛盾。","en":"His words are self-contradictory."},{"zh":"这个说法自相矛盾。","en":"This statement contradicts itself."},{"zh":"别自相矛盾。","en":"Don't contradict yourself."}],"example":"他的话自相矛盾。","exampleTrans":"His words are self-contradictory."},{"id":"idiom-10","word":"画蛇添足","pinyin":["huà","shé","tiān","zú"],"flat":"huashetianzu","flatSpaced":"hua she tian zu","toneNum":"hua4 she2 tian1 zu2","initials":"hstz","syllables":["hua","she","tian","zu"],"trans":"to ruin by adding too much; redundant","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"这真是画蛇添足。","en":"This is really adding legs to a snake."},{"zh":"多此一举，画蛇添足。","en":"Superfluous, like adding legs to a snake."},{"zh":"别画蛇添足了。","en":"Don't gild the lily."}],"example":"这真是画蛇添足。","exampleTrans":"This is really adding legs to a snake."},{"id":"idiom-11","word":"守株待兔","pinyin":["shǒu","zhū","dài","tù"],"flat":"shouzhudaitu","flatSpaced":"shou zhu dai tu","toneNum":"shou3 zhu1 dai4 tu4","initials":"szdt","syllables":["shou","zhu","dai","tu"],"trans":"wait idly for gains; foolishly hopeful","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"你不能守株待兔。","en":"You cannot just wait idly for success."},{"zh":"守株待兔是不行的。","en":"Waiting passively does not work."},{"zh":"别守株待兔了。","en":"Don't sit around waiting."}],"example":"你不能守株待兔。","exampleTrans":"You cannot just wait idly for success."},{"id":"idiom-12","word":"亡羊补牢","pinyin":["wáng","yáng","bǔ","láo"],"flat":"wangyangbulao","flatSpaced":"wang yang bu lao","toneNum":"wang2 yang2 bu3 lao2","initials":"wybl","syllables":["wang","yang","bu","lao"],"trans":"mend the fold after losing sheep; rectify in time","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"现在补救还来得及，亡羊补牢。","en":"It is not too late to mend the fold."},{"zh":"亡羊补牢，为时不晚。","en":"Better late than never."},{"zh":"出了问题要亡羊补牢。","en":"Fix problems as soon as they appear."}],"example":"现在补救还来得及，亡羊补牢。","exampleTrans":"It is not too late to mend the fold."},{"id":"idiom-13","word":"掩耳盗铃","pinyin":["yǎn","ěr","dào","líng"],"flat":"yanerdaoling","flatSpaced":"yan er dao ling","toneNum":"yan3 er3 dao4 ling2","initials":"yedl","syllables":["yan","er","dao","ling"],"trans":"deceive oneself (lit. cover ears stealing a bell)","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"这是掩耳盗铃。","en":"This is deceiving oneself."},{"zh":"别掩耳盗铃了。","en":"Don't bury your head in the sand."},{"zh":"他的做法像掩耳盗铃。","en":"His approach is self-deception."}],"example":"这是掩耳盗铃。","exampleTrans":"This is deceiving oneself."},{"id":"idiom-14","word":"刻舟求剑","pinyin":["kè","zhōu","qiú","jiàn"],"flat":"kezhouqiujian","flatSpaced":"ke zhou qiu jian","toneNum":"ke4 zhou1 qiu2 jian4","initials":"kzqj","syllables":["ke","zhou","qiu","jian"],"trans":"rigid; fail to adapt","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他这是刻舟求剑。","en":"He is being rigid."},{"zh":"情况变了，别刻舟求剑。","en":"Things changed; don't be inflexible."},{"zh":"刻舟求剑是不行的。","en":"Being rigid does not work."}],"example":"他这是刻舟求剑。","exampleTrans":"He is being rigid."},{"id":"idiom-15","word":"井底之蛙","pinyin":["jǐng","dǐ","zhī","wā"],"flat":"jingdizhiwa","flatSpaced":"jing di zhi wa","toneNum":"jing3 di3 zhi1 wa1","initials":"jdzw","syllables":["jing","di","zhi","wa"],"trans":"a frog in a well; narrow-minded","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他像井底之蛙。","en":"He is like a frog in a well."},{"zh":"别做井底之蛙。","en":"Don't be narrow-minded."},{"zh":"井底之蛙不知大海。","en":"A frog in a well knows not the sea."}],"example":"他像井底之蛙。","exampleTrans":"He is like a frog in a well."},{"id":"idiom-16","word":"杯弓蛇影","pinyin":["bēi","gōng","shé","yǐng"],"flat":"beigongsheying","flatSpaced":"bei gong she ying","toneNum":"bei1 gong1 she2 ying3","initials":"bgsy","syllables":["bei","gong","she","ying"],"trans":"mistaken fear; paranoid","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他杯弓蛇影，自己吓自己。","en":"He is paranoid, scaring himself."},{"zh":"别杯弓蛇影了。","en":"Don't be paranoid."},{"zh":"这真是杯弓蛇影。","en":"This is needless fear."}],"example":"他杯弓蛇影，自己吓自己。","exampleTrans":"He is paranoid, scaring himself."},{"id":"idiom-17","word":"对牛弹琴","pinyin":["duì","niú","tán","qín"],"flat":"duiniutanqin","flatSpaced":"dui niu tan qin","toneNum":"dui4 niu2 tan2 qin2","initials":"dntq","syllables":["dui","niu","tan","qin"],"trans":"cast pearls before swine; preach to deaf ears","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"对牛弹琴没用。","en":"Playing the lute to a cow is useless."},{"zh":"别对牛弹琴了。","en":"Don't preach to deaf ears."},{"zh":"跟他讲道理是对牛弹琴。","en":"Reasoning with him is pointless."}],"example":"对牛弹琴没用。","exampleTrans":"Playing the lute to a cow is useless."},{"id":"idiom-18","word":"狐假虎威","pinyin":["hú","jiǎ","hǔ","wēi"],"flat":"hujiahuwei","flatSpaced":"hu jia hu wei","toneNum":"hu2 jia3 hu3 wei1","initials":"hjhw","syllables":["hu","jia","hu","wei"],"trans":"bully by flaunting another's power","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他狐假虎威。","en":"He bullies by flaunting others' power."},{"zh":"别狐假虎威。","en":"Don't abuse borrowed authority."},{"zh":"他仗势欺人，狐假虎威。","en":"He bullies others using power."}],"example":"他狐假虎威。","exampleTrans":"He bullies by flaunting others' power."},{"id":"idiom-19","word":"画龙点睛","pinyin":["huà","lóng","diǎn","jīng"],"flat":"hualongdianjing","flatSpaced":"hua long dian jing","toneNum":"hua4 long2 dian3 jing1","initials":"hldj","syllables":["hua","long","dian","jing"],"trans":"add the finishing touch","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"这句话画龙点睛。","en":"This sentence is the finishing touch."},{"zh":"他的评论画龙点睛。","en":"His comment added the perfect touch."},{"zh":"最后一句画龙点睛。","en":"The last line perfects it."}],"example":"这句话画龙点睛。","exampleTrans":"This sentence is the finishing touch."},{"id":"idiom-20","word":"滥竽充数","pinyin":["làn","yú","chōng","shù"],"flat":"lanyuchongshu","flatSpaced":"lan yu chong shu","toneNum":"lan4 yu2 chong1 shu4","initials":"lycs","syllables":["lan","yu","chong","shu"],"trans":"pass off as competent; fake it","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他滥竽充数。","en":"He fakes his competence."},{"zh":"别滥竽充数。","en":"Don't pretend to be skilled."},{"zh":"团队里不能滥竽充数。","en":"The team cannot have fakes."}],"example":"他滥竽充数。","exampleTrans":"He fakes his competence."},{"id":"idiom-21","word":"盲人摸象","pinyin":["máng","rén","mō","xiàng"],"flat":"mangrenmoxiang","flatSpaced":"mang ren mo xiang","toneNum":"mang2 ren2 mo1 xiang4","initials":"mrmx","syllables":["mang","ren","mo","xiang"],"trans":"take a part for the whole","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"这像盲人摸象。","en":"This is like blind men feeling an elephant."},{"zh":"别盲人摸象。","en":"Don't judge the whole by a part."},{"zh":"他的看法是盲人摸象。","en":"His view is one-sided."}],"example":"这像盲人摸象。","exampleTrans":"This is like blind men feeling an elephant."},{"id":"idiom-22","word":"磨杵成针","pinyin":["mó","chǔ","chéng","zhēn"],"flat":"mochuchengzhen","flatSpaced":"mo chu cheng zhen","toneNum":"mo2 chu3 cheng2 zhen1","initials":"mccz","syllables":["mo","chu","cheng","zhen"],"trans":"perseverance; grind iron to a needle","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"只要坚持，磨杵成针。","en":"With persistence, you can grind iron to a needle."},{"zh":"磨杵成针靠毅力。","en":"Perseverance makes it possible."},{"zh":"学习要磨杵成针。","en":"Learning needs perseverance."}],"example":"只要坚持，磨杵成针。","exampleTrans":"With persistence, you can grind iron to a needle."},{"id":"idiom-23","word":"破釜沉舟","pinyin":["pò","fǔ","chén","zhōu"],"flat":"pofuchenzhou","flatSpaced":"po fu chen zhou","toneNum":"po4 fu3 chen2 zhou1","initials":"pfcz","syllables":["po","fu","chen","zhou"],"trans":"burn one's boats; fight with no retreat","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他破釜沉舟。","en":"He burned his boats."},{"zh":"破釜沉舟，全力以赴。","en":"Go all out with no retreat."},{"zh":"这次我们破釜沉舟。","en":"This time we commit fully."}],"example":"他破釜沉舟。","exampleTrans":"He burned his boats."},{"id":"idiom-24","word":"塞翁失马","pinyin":["sài","wēng","shī","mǎ"],"flat":"saiwengshima","flatSpaced":"sai weng shi ma","toneNum":"sai4 weng1 shi1 ma3","initials":"swsm","syllables":["sai","weng","shi","ma"],"trans":"a blessing in disguise","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"塞翁失马，焉知非福。","en":"A loss may turn out to be a gain."},{"zh":"这也许是塞翁失马。","en":"This may be a blessing in disguise."},{"zh":"塞翁失马，不必难过。","en":"Don't be sad; it may be good luck."}],"example":"塞翁失马，焉知非福。","exampleTrans":"A loss may turn out to be a gain."},{"id":"idiom-25","word":"熟能生巧","pinyin":["shú","néng","shēng","qiǎo"],"flat":"shunengshengqiao","flatSpaced":"shu neng sheng qiao","toneNum":"shu2 neng2 sheng1 qiao3","initials":"snsq","syllables":["shu","neng","sheng","qiao"],"trans":"practice makes perfect","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"熟能生巧。","en":"Practice makes perfect."},{"zh":"多练，熟能生巧。","en":"Practice more; it becomes perfect."},{"zh":"打字也是熟能生巧。","en":"Typing also improves with practice."}],"example":"熟能生巧。","exampleTrans":"Practice makes perfect."},{"id":"idiom-26","word":"望梅止渴","pinyin":["wàng","méi","zhǐ","kě"],"flat":"wangmeizhike","flatSpaced":"wang mei zhi ke","toneNum":"wang4 mei2 zhi3 ke3","initials":"wmzk","syllables":["wang","mei","zhi","ke"],"trans":"false comfort; vain hope","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"这只是望梅止渴。","en":"This is just false comfort."},{"zh":"别望梅止渴了。","en":"Don't rely on vain hope."},{"zh":"望梅止渴解决不了问题。","en":"False comfort solves nothing."}],"example":"这只是望梅止渴。","exampleTrans":"This is just false comfort."},{"id":"idiom-27","word":"闻鸡起舞","pinyin":["wén","jī","qǐ","wǔ"],"flat":"wenjiqiwu","flatSpaced":"wen ji qi wu","toneNum":"wen2 ji1 qi3 wu3","initials":"wjqw","syllables":["wen","ji","qi","wu"],"trans":"diligent; rise at cockcrow to practice","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他闻鸡起舞，非常勤奋。","en":"He is diligent, rising early to practice."},{"zh":"我们要闻鸡起舞。","en":"We should be diligent."},{"zh":"古人闻鸡起舞。","en":"The ancients practiced at dawn."}],"example":"他闻鸡起舞，非常勤奋。","exampleTrans":"He is diligent, rising early to practice."},{"id":"idiom-28","word":"胸有成竹","pinyin":["xiōng","yǒu","chéng","zhú"],"flat":"xiongyouchengzhu","flatSpaced":"xiong you cheng zhu","toneNum":"xiong1 you3 cheng2 zhu2","initials":"xycz","syllables":["xiong","you","cheng","zhu"],"trans":"have a well-thought-out plan","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他胸有成竹。","en":"He has a well-thought-out plan."},{"zh":"做事要胸有成竹。","en":"Act with a clear plan."},{"zh":"她胸有成竹地回答。","en":"She answered with confidence."}],"example":"他胸有成竹。","exampleTrans":"He has a well-thought-out plan."},{"id":"idiom-29","word":"一举两得","pinyin":["yì","jǔ","liǎng","dé"],"flat":"yijuliangde","flatSpaced":"yi ju liang de","toneNum":"yi4 ju3 liang3 de2","initials":"yjld","syllables":["yi","ju","liang","de"],"trans":"kill two birds with one stone","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"这真是一举两得。","en":"This kills two birds with one stone."},{"zh":"一举两得的好办法。","en":"A method that gains twice."},{"zh":"既能学习又能玩，一举两得。","en":"Learn and play — two gains at once."}],"example":"这真是一举两得。","exampleTrans":"This kills two birds with one stone."},{"id":"idiom-30","word":"精益求精","pinyin":["jīng","yì","qiú","jīng"],"flat":"jingyiqiujing","flatSpaced":"jing yi qiu jing","toneNum":"jing1 yi4 qiu2 jing1","initials":"jyqj","syllables":["jing","yi","qiu","jing"],"trans":"strive for perfection","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他精益求精。","en":"He strives for perfection."},{"zh":"工作要精益求精。","en":"Work should aim for excellence."},{"zh":"精益求精的态度。","en":"An attitude of constant improvement."}],"example":"他精益求精。","exampleTrans":"He strives for perfection."},{"id":"idiom-31","word":"锦上添花","pinyin":["jǐn","shàng","tiān","huā"],"flat":"jinshangtianhua","flatSpaced":"jin shang tian hua","toneNum":"jin3 shang4 tian1 hua1","initials":"jsth","syllables":["jin","shang","tian","hua"],"trans":"add flowers to brocade; make perfect better","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"这真是锦上添花。","en":"This adds icing to the cake."},{"zh":"好上加好，锦上添花。","en":"Better made even better."},{"zh":"你的帮助是锦上添花。","en":"Your help makes it even better."}],"example":"这真是锦上添花。","exampleTrans":"This adds icing to the cake."},{"id":"idiom-32","word":"名副其实","pinyin":["míng","fù","qí","shí"],"flat":"mingfuqishi","flatSpaced":"ming fu qi shi","toneNum":"ming2 fu4 qi2 shi2","initials":"mfqs","syllables":["ming","fu","qi","shi"],"trans":"true to its name; deserved","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"这里名副其实。","en":"It lives up to its name."},{"zh":"他是名副其实的专家。","en":"He is a true expert."},{"zh":"名副其实的美景。","en":"A scenery true to its name."}],"example":"这里名副其实。","exampleTrans":"It lives up to its name."},{"id":"idiom-33","word":"全力以赴","pinyin":["quán","lì","yǐ","fù"],"flat":"quanliyifu","flatSpaced":"quan li yi fu","toneNum":"quan2 li4 yi3 fu4","initials":"qlyf","syllables":["quan","li","yi","fu"],"trans":"go all out","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"我们全力以赴。","en":"We go all out."},{"zh":"请全力以赴。","en":"Please give it your all."},{"zh":"他全力以赴地工作。","en":"He works with all his might."}],"example":"我们全力以赴。","exampleTrans":"We go all out."},{"id":"idiom-34","word":"日新月异","pinyin":["rì","xīn","yuè","yì"],"flat":"rixinyueyi","flatSpaced":"ri xin yue yi","toneNum":"ri4 xin1 yue4 yi4","initials":"rxyy","syllables":["ri","xin","yue","yi"],"trans":"changing rapidly (each day new)","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"科技日新月异。","en":"Technology changes daily."},{"zh":"世界日新月异。","en":"The world changes rapidly."},{"zh":"城市日新月异。","en":"The city changes fast."}],"example":"科技日新月异。","exampleTrans":"Technology changes daily."},{"id":"idiom-35","word":"三顾茅庐","pinyin":["sān","gù","máo","lú"],"flat":"sangumaolu","flatSpaced":"san gu mao lu","toneNum":"san1 gu4 mao2 lu2","initials":"sgml","syllables":["san","gu","mao","lu"],"trans":"earnestly request; repeated visits","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他三顾茅庐请人才。","en":"He visited thrice to invite talent."},{"zh":"三顾茅庐的精神。","en":"The spirit of sincere invitation."},{"zh":"为了项目，他三顾茅庐。","en":"For the project, he made repeated visits."}],"example":"他三顾茅庐请人才。","exampleTrans":"He visited thrice to invite talent."},{"id":"idiom-36","word":"水到渠成","pinyin":["shuǐ","dào","qú","chéng"],"flat":"shuidaoqucheng","flatSpaced":"shui dao qu cheng","toneNum":"shui3 dao4 qu2 cheng2","initials":"sdqc","syllables":["shui","dao","qu","cheng"],"trans":"things fall into place when conditions are ready","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"努力后水到渠成。","en":"With effort, success comes naturally."},{"zh":"水到渠成，不必着急。","en":"It will come in time; don't rush."},{"zh":"准备充分，水到渠成。","en":"Well prepared, it falls into place."}],"example":"努力后水到渠成。","exampleTrans":"With effort, success comes naturally."},{"id":"idiom-37","word":"无微不至","pinyin":["wú","wēi","bú","zhì"],"flat":"wuweibuzhi","flatSpaced":"wu wei bu zhi","toneNum":"wu2 wei1 bu2 zhi4","initials":"wwbz","syllables":["wu","wei","bu","zhi"],"trans":"meticulous; with great care","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"妈妈照顾得无微不至。","en":"Mom cares for me meticulously."},{"zh":"他的关心无微不至。","en":"His care is thorough."},{"zh":"老师对我们无微不至。","en":"The teacher cares for us deeply."}],"example":"妈妈照顾得无微不至。","exampleTrans":"Mom cares for me meticulously."},{"id":"idiom-38","word":"一举成名","pinyin":["yì","jǔ","chéng","míng"],"flat":"yijuchengming","flatSpaced":"yi ju cheng ming","toneNum":"yi4 ju3 cheng2 ming2","initials":"yjcm","syllables":["yi","ju","cheng","ming"],"trans":"rise to fame overnight","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"他一举成名。","en":"He rose to fame overnight."},{"zh":"这位歌手一举成名。","en":"This singer became famous at once."},{"zh":"希望你能一举成名。","en":"Hope you become famous overnight."}],"example":"他一举成名。","exampleTrans":"He rose to fame overnight."},{"id":"idiom-39","word":"坐井观天","pinyin":["zuò","jǐng","guān","tiān"],"flat":"zuojingguantian","flatSpaced":"zuo jing guan tian","toneNum":"zuo4 jing3 guan1 tian1","initials":"zjgt","syllables":["zuo","jing","guan","tian"],"trans":"limited outlook (frog in a well)","length":4,"examples":[{"zh":"别坐井观天。","en":"Don't have a limited outlook."},{"zh":"坐井观天见识短。","en":"A narrow view sees little."},{"zh":"他坐井观天，不知世界大。","en":"He has a narrow view of the world."}],"example":"别坐井观天。","exampleTrans":"Don't have a limited outlook."}]}